<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>256 Logistics Compliance Hub — Two licences. Zero surprises.</title>
  <meta name="description" content="Purpose-built compliance for UK HGV operators. Keep your DVSA Operator's Licence and Home Office Sponsor Licence audit-ready, every single day.">
  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
  <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:wght@300;400;500;600;700;800;900&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
  <style>
    *, *::before, *::after { box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0; padding: 0; }

    :root {
      --navy: #0a1628;
      --navy-2: #0c1a30;
      --navy-3: #0f2042;
      --blue: #2563eb;
      --blue-light: #3b82f6;
      --blue-200: #93c5fd;
      --cyan: #06b6d4;
      --green: #10b981;
      --amber: #f59e0b;
      --red: #ef4444;
      --ink-100: #f1f5f9;
      --ink-300: #cbd5e1;
      --ink-400: #94a3b8;
      --ink-500: #64748b;
      --line: rgba(148,163,184,0.12);
    }

    html { scroll-behavior: smooth; }
    body {
      font-family: 'Inter', sans-serif;
      background: var(--navy);
      color: var(--ink-300);
      -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased;
      overflow-x: hidden;
      line-height: 1.6;
    }

    a { color: inherit; text-decoration: none; }
    .wrap { max-width: 1180px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 0 28px; }

    /* ── Ambient background ─────────────────────────────── */
    .bg-field { position: fixed; inset: 0; z-index: 0; pointer-events: none; }
    .bg-grid {
      position: absolute; inset: 0;
      background-image:
        linear-gradient(rgba(59,130,246,0.035) 1px, transparent 1px),
        linear-gradient(90deg, rgba(59,130,246,0.035) 1px, transparent 1px);
      background-size: 54px 54px;
      mask-image: radial-gradient(ellipse 90% 60% at 50% 0%, #000 30%, transparent 100%);
    }
    .orb { position: absolute; border-radius: 50%; filter: blur(90px); opacity: 0.5; }
    .orb-a { width: 560px; height: 560px; background: rgba(37,99,235,0.28); top: -180px; right: -120px; }
    .orb-b { width: 420px; height: 420px; background: rgba(6,182,212,0.14); top: 40%; left: -160px; }
    .orb-c { width: 380px; height: 380px; background: rgba(16,185,129,0.10); bottom: -120px; right: 10%; }

    main { position: relative; z-index: 1; }

    /* ── Top bar ────────────────────────────────────────── */
    .nav {
      position: sticky; top: 0; z-index: 50;
      backdrop-filter: blur(14px);
      background: rgba(10,22,40,0.72);
      border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line);
    }
    .nav-inner { display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between; height: 64px; }
    .brand { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 11px; font-weight: 800; color: #fff; letter-spacing: -0.3px; }
    .brand .dots { display: flex; gap: 4px; }
    .brand .dots i { width: 9px; height: 9px; border-radius: 50%; display: block; }
    .brand .dots .r { background: var(--red); }
    .brand .dots .y { background: var(--amber); }
    .brand .dots .g { background: var(--green); box-shadow: 0 0 8px var(--green); }
    .brand small { display: block; font-size: 10.5px; font-weight: 500; color: var(--ink-400); letter-spacing: 1px; text-transform: uppercase; }
    .nav-cta {
      display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px;
      background: var(--blue); color: #fff; font-weight: 600; font-size: 14px;
      padding: 9px 18px; border-radius: 10px; transition: all .2s;
      box-shadow: 0 4px 14px rgba(37,99,235,0.35);
    }
    .nav-cta:hover { transform: translateY(-1px); box-shadow: 0 6px 20px rgba(37,99,235,0.5); }

    /* ── Reveal on scroll ───────────────────────────────── */
    .reveal { opacity: 0; transform: translateY(26px); transition: opacity .8s cubic-bezier(.2,.7,.2,1), transform .8s cubic-bezier(.2,.7,.2,1); }
    .reveal.in { opacity: 1; transform: none; }
    .reveal.d1 { transition-delay: .08s; } .reveal.d2 { transition-delay: .16s; }
    .reveal.d3 { transition-delay: .24s; } .reveal.d4 { transition-delay: .32s; }

    /* ── Section scaffolding ────────────────────────────── */
    section { padding: 104px 0; position: relative; }
    .eyebrow {
      display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 9px;
      font-size: 12px; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 1.6px; text-transform: uppercase;
      color: var(--blue-200);
      background: rgba(59,130,246,0.10); border: 1px solid rgba(59,130,246,0.22);
      padding: 7px 14px; border-radius: 100px; margin-bottom: 22px;
    }
    .eyebrow .pip { width: 7px; height: 7px; border-radius: 50%; background: var(--blue-light); box-shadow: 0 0 8px var(--blue-light); animation: pip 2s infinite; }
    @keyframes pip { 0%,100%{opacity:1;transform:scale(1)} 50%{opacity:.5;transform:scale(1.4)} }
    h2.section-title { font-size: clamp(28px, 4vw, 44px); font-weight: 800; color: #fff; letter-spacing: -1px; line-height: 1.1; }
    .section-lead { font-size: 17px; color: var(--ink-400); max-width: 560px; margin-top: 18px; }
    .muted { color: var(--ink-500); }

    /* ── HERO ───────────────────────────────────────────── */
    .hero { padding: 80px 0 60px; }
    .hero-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1.15fr 0.85fr; gap: 40px; align-items: center; }
    .hero h1 {
      font-size: clamp(38px, 6vw, 68px); font-weight: 900; color: #fff;
      letter-spacing: -2.5px; line-height: 1.02;
    }
    .hero h1 .grad {
      background: linear-gradient(120deg, #60a5fa, #22d3ee 60%, #34d399);
      -webkit-background-clip: text; background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;
    }
    .hero p.lead { font-size: 19px; color: var(--ink-300); max-width: 520px; margin: 26px 0 0; line-height: 1.65; }
    .hero-actions { display: flex; gap: 14px; margin-top: 36px; flex-wrap: wrap; }
    .btn {
      display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 9px; font-weight: 600; font-size: 15px;
      padding: 14px 26px; border-radius: 12px; transition: all .2s; cursor: pointer; border: none;
    }
    .btn-primary { background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--blue), #1d4ed8); color: #fff; box-shadow: 0 8px 24px rgba(37,99,235,0.4); }
    .btn-primary:hover { transform: translateY(-2px); box-shadow: 0 12px 32px rgba(37,99,235,0.55); }
    .btn-ghost { background: rgba(255,255,255,0.04); color: var(--ink-100); border: 1px solid var(--line); }
    .btn-ghost:hover { background: rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-color: rgba(148,163,184,0.25); }

    .hero-stage { position: relative; display: flex; justify-content: center; align-items: center; min-height: 420px; }
    .hero-signal { width: 220px; filter: drop-shadow(0 20px 50px rgba(16,185,129,0.25)); animation: rise 1.1s cubic-bezier(.2,.8,.2,1) both; }
    @keyframes rise { from { opacity: 0; transform: translateY(30px) scale(.96); } to { opacity: 1; transform: none; } }
    .hero-chip {
      position: absolute; display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 9px;
      background: rgba(12,26,48,0.9); border: 1px solid var(--line); backdrop-filter: blur(8px);
      padding: 10px 14px; border-radius: 12px; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 600; color: var(--ink-100);
      box-shadow: 0 12px 30px rgba(0,0,0,0.4); animation: floaty 5s ease-in-out infinite;
    }
    .hero-chip .ic { width: 26px; height: 26px; border-radius: 8px; display: grid; place-items: center; flex-shrink: 0; }
    .hero-chip small { display: block; font-size: 11px; font-weight: 500; color: var(--ink-400); }
    .chip-1 { top: 40px; left: -8px; animation-delay: 0s; }
    .chip-2 { bottom: 70px; right: -16px; animation-delay: -2.5s; }
    @keyframes floaty { 0%,100%{transform:translateY(0)} 50%{transform:translateY(-12px)} }

    .hero-trust { display: flex; gap: 28px; margin-top: 44px; padding-top: 28px; border-top: 1px solid var(--line); flex-wrap: wrap; }
    .hero-trust .it .n { font-size: 24px; font-weight: 800; color: #fff; }
    .hero-trust .it .l { font-size: 12.5px; color: var(--ink-500); margin-top: 2px; }

    /* ── STAKES (two licences) ──────────────────────────── */
    .stakes-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: 22px; margin-top: 50px; }
    .stake {
      position: relative; background: linear-gradient(180deg, rgba(20,35,60,0.7), rgba(13,26,46,0.7));
      border: 1px solid var(--line); border-radius: 20px; padding: 34px 30px; overflow: hidden;
    }
    .stake::before { content: ''; position: absolute; top: 0; left: 0; right: 0; height: 3px; }
    .stake.dvsa::before { background: linear-gradient(90deg, var(--blue), var(--cyan)); }
    .stake.ho::before { background: linear-gradient(90deg, #8b5cf6, var(--blue-light)); }
    .stake-ic { width: 54px; height: 54px; border-radius: 14px; display: grid; place-items: center; margin-bottom: 20px; }
    .stake.dvsa .stake-ic { background: rgba(37,99,235,0.14); border: 1px solid rgba(59,130,246,0.3); }
    .stake.ho .stake-ic { background: rgba(139,92,246,0.14); border: 1px solid rgba(139,92,246,0.32); }
    .stake h3 { font-size: 20px; color: #fff; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 6px; }
    .stake .auth { font-size: 12.5px; font-weight: 600; letter-spacing: .4px; text-transform: uppercase; margin-bottom: 16px; }
    .stake.dvsa .auth { color: var(--blue-200); }
    .stake.ho .auth { color: #c4b5fd; }
    .stake p { font-size: 15px; color: var(--ink-400); }
    .stake .risk { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px; margin-top: 18px; font-size: 13px; color: #fca5a5; font-weight: 600; }

    /* ── PROBLEM → SHIFT split ──────────────────────────── */
    .split { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: 0; border: 1px solid var(--line); border-radius: 22px; overflow: hidden; margin-top: 50px; }
    .split .col { padding: 44px 40px; }
    .split .before { background: linear-gradient(180deg, rgba(40,20,20,0.35), rgba(13,26,46,0.2)); border-right: 1px solid var(--line); }
    .split .after { background: linear-gradient(180deg, rgba(16,40,30,0.32), rgba(13,26,46,0.2)); }
    .split h4 { font-size: 13px; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 1.2px; text-transform: uppercase; margin-bottom: 22px; display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 9px; }
    .split .before h4 { color: #fca5a5; }
    .split .after h4 { color: #6ee7b7; }
    .pt { display: flex; gap: 13px; padding: 13px 0; border-bottom: 1px dashed var(--line); }
    .pt:last-child { border-bottom: none; }
    .pt .mk { width: 22px; height: 22px; border-radius: 7px; flex-shrink: 0; display: grid; place-items: center; margin-top: 1px; }
    .before .mk { background: rgba(239,68,68,0.14); }
    .after .mk { background: rgba(16,185,129,0.16); }
    .pt span { font-size: 14.5px; color: var(--ink-300); }
    .pt .muted2 { color: var(--ink-500); }

    /* ── SYSTEM (network) ───────────────────────────────── */
    .sys-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 0.95fr 1.05fr; gap: 50px; align-items: center; }
    .sys-art { width: 100%; }

    /* ── PILLARS ────────────────────────────────────────── */
    .pillars { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr); gap: 18px; margin-top: 52px; }
    .pillar {
      background: linear-gradient(180deg, rgba(18,32,56,0.6), rgba(12,24,44,0.6));
      border: 1px solid var(--line); border-radius: 18px; padding: 28px 26px; transition: all .25s;
    }
    .pillar:hover { transform: translateY(-4px); border-color: rgba(59,130,246,0.35); box-shadow: 0 18px 40px rgba(0,0,0,0.35); }
    .pillar .p-ic { width: 50px; height: 50px; border-radius: 13px; background: rgba(37,99,235,0.12); border: 1px solid rgba(59,130,246,0.25); display: grid; place-items: center; margin-bottom: 18px; }
    .pillar .p-num { font-size: 12px; font-weight: 700; color: var(--blue-200); letter-spacing: 1px; }
    .pillar h3 { font-size: 18px; color: #fff; font-weight: 700; margin: 8px 0 9px; }
    .pillar p { font-size: 14px; color: var(--ink-400); }

    /* ── MOMENT OF TRUTH ────────────────────────────────── */
    .truth-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: 48px; align-items: center; }
    .truth-steps { margin-top: 26px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 16px; }
    .tstep { display: flex; gap: 15px; align-items: flex-start; }
    .tstep .tn { width: 30px; height: 30px; border-radius: 9px; background: rgba(16,185,129,0.14); border: 1px solid rgba(16,185,129,0.3); color: #6ee7b7; font-weight: 800; font-size: 14px; display: grid; place-items: center; flex-shrink: 0; }
    .tstep .tt { font-size: 15px; color: var(--ink-300); }
    .tstep .tt b { color: #fff; font-weight: 600; }

    /* ── SCORE ──────────────────────────────────────────── */
    .score { text-align: center; }
    .gauge-wrap { display: flex; justify-content: center; margin: 42px 0 8px; }
    .gauge { position: relative; width: 260px; height: 260px; }
    .gauge svg { transform: rotate(-90deg); }
    .gauge .ring-bg { stroke: rgba(148,163,184,0.12); }
    .gauge .ring-fg { stroke: url(#g-grad); stroke-linecap: round; transition: stroke-dashoffset 2s cubic-bezier(.2,.8,.2,1); }
    .gauge .val { position: absolute; inset: 0; display: grid; place-content: center; text-align: center; }
    .gauge .val .num { font-size: 58px; font-weight: 900; color: #fff; letter-spacing: -2px; line-height: 1; }
    .gauge .val .lbl { font-size: 12.5px; color: var(--ink-400); letter-spacing: 1px; text-transform: uppercase; margin-top: 6px; }
    .score-legend { display: flex; justify-content: center; gap: 26px; margin-top: 18px; flex-wrap: wrap; }
    .score-legend .lg { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px; font-size: 13px; color: var(--ink-400); }
    .score-legend .lg i { width: 10px; height: 10px; border-radius: 50%; }

    /* ── FINAL CTA ──────────────────────────────────────── */
    .cta {
      text-align: center; border: 1px solid rgba(59,130,246,0.25); border-radius: 28px;
      padding: 72px 40px; position: relative; overflow: hidden;
      background: radial-gradient(ellipse 80% 120% at 50% -20%, rgba(37,99,235,0.25), transparent 70%), linear-gradient(180deg, rgba(15,32,66,0.6), rgba(10,22,40,0.6));
    }
    .cta h2 { font-size: clamp(30px, 4.5vw, 50px); font-weight: 900; color: #fff; letter-spacing: -1.5px; line-height: 1.05; }
    .cta p { font-size: 18px; color: var(--ink-300); max-width: 540px; margin: 20px auto 36px; }

    /* ── ECADEL credit ──────────────────────────────────── */
    .credit { padding: 96px 0 40px; }
    .credit-card {
      position: relative; overflow: hidden;
      display: grid; grid-template-columns: auto 1fr auto; gap: 34px; align-items: center;
      padding: 40px 44px; border-radius: 26px;
      background:
        radial-gradient(ellipse 70% 140% at 12% 0%, rgba(245,158,11,0.12), transparent 60%),
        linear-gradient(180deg, rgba(22,36,61,0.7), rgba(10,20,36,0.7));
      border: 1px solid rgba(245,158,11,0.22);
      box-shadow: 0 30px 80px rgba(0,0,0,0.4);
    }
    .credit-card::before {
      content: ''; position: absolute; inset: 0; pointer-events: none;
      background: linear-gradient(90deg, transparent, rgba(253,230,138,0.04) 40%, transparent);
    }
    .credit-seal { width: 96px; height: 96px; filter: drop-shadow(0 8px 26px rgba(245,158,11,0.4)); animation: sealfloat 6s ease-in-out infinite; }
    @keyframes sealfloat { 0%,100%{transform:translateY(0) rotate(0)} 50%{transform:translateY(-8px) rotate(-1.5deg)} }
    .credit-body { position: relative; z-index: 1; }
    .credit-eyebrow {
      display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 9px;
      font-size: 11.5px; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 2.4px; text-transform: uppercase;
      color: #fcd34d; margin-bottom: 12px;
    }
    .credit-eyebrow .ln { width: 26px; height: 1px; background: linear-gradient(90deg, #f59e0b, transparent); }
    .credit-name {
      font-size: clamp(26px, 3.4vw, 38px); font-weight: 900; letter-spacing: -0.5px; line-height: 1.05;
      background: linear-gradient(100deg, #fffbeb, #fcd34d 55%, #f59e0b);
      -webkit-background-clip: text; background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;
    }
    .credit-tag { font-size: 15.5px; color: var(--ink-300); max-width: 560px; margin-top: 12px; line-height: 1.6; }
    .credit-tag b { color: #fff; font-weight: 600; }
    .credit-cta {
      display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 9px; white-space: nowrap;
      font-weight: 700; font-size: 14.5px; color: #1a1205;
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, #fde68a, #f59e0b); padding: 13px 22px; border-radius: 12px;
      box-shadow: 0 10px 28px rgba(245,158,11,0.35); transition: all .2s;
    }
    .credit-cta:hover { transform: translateY(-2px); box-shadow: 0 14px 36px rgba(245,158,11,0.5); }
    .credit-meta { display: flex; gap: 22px; margin-top: 20px; flex-wrap: wrap; }
    .credit-meta .cm { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px; font-size: 12.5px; color: var(--ink-400); }
    .credit-meta .cm svg { color: #f59e0b; }

    /* ── Footer ─────────────────────────────────────────── */
    footer { border-top: 1px solid var(--line); padding: 40px 0; }
    .foot-inner { display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 16px; }
    .foot-links { display: flex; gap: 24px; font-size: 14px; color: var(--ink-400); }
    .foot-links a:hover { color: #fff; }
    .foot-copy { font-size: 13px; color: var(--ink-500); }
    .foot-copy b { color: #fcd34d; font-weight: 600; }

    /* ── Responsive ─────────────────────────────────────── */
    @media (max-width: 920px) {
      .hero-grid, .sys-grid, .truth-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
      .hero-stage { min-height: 340px; order: -1; }
      .stakes-grid, .split, .pillars { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
      .split .before { border-right: none; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line); }
      section { padding: 76px 0; }
      .credit-card { grid-template-columns: 1fr; text-align: center; gap: 22px; padding: 36px 26px; }
      .credit-seal { margin: 0 auto; }
      .credit-eyebrow, .credit-meta { justify-content: center; }
      .credit-tag { margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto; }
    }
    @media (max-width: 560px) {
      .wrap { padding: 0 18px; }
      .brand small { display: none; }
      .hero-trust { gap: 20px; }
      .nav-cta span.full { display: none; }
    }
    @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {
      .reveal { opacity: 1; transform: none; transition: none; }
      * { animation: none !important; }
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>

  <div class="bg-field">
    <div class="bg-grid"></div>
    <div class="orb orb-a"></div>
    <div class="orb orb-b"></div>
    <div class="orb orb-c"></div>
  </div>

  <!-- ── Nav ──────────────────────────────────────────── -->
  <div class="nav">
    <div class="wrap nav-inner">
      <a href="/welcome" class="brand">
        <span class="dots"><i class="r"></i><i class="y"></i><i class="g"></i></span>
        <span>256 Logistics<small>Compliance Hub</small></span>
      </a>
      <a href="/login" class="nav-cta">
        <span class="full">Sign in</span>
        <svg width="16" height="16" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M11 16l-4-4m0 0l4-4m-4 4h14M3 12a9 9 0 1118 0 9 9 0 01-18 0z"/></svg>
      </a>
    </div>
  </div>

  <main>

    <!-- ── HERO ───────────────────────────────────────── -->
    <section class="hero">
      <div class="wrap hero-grid">
        <div class="hero-copy">
          <div class="eyebrow reveal in"><span class="pip"></span>UK HGV Operator Compliance</div>
          <h1 class="reveal in d1">Two licences.<br><span class="grad">Zero surprises.</span></h1>
          <p class="lead reveal in d2">
            A UK haulier runs on two government licences — and a single expired document can take both away.
            256 Logistics watches every driver, vehicle, and certificate, every day, so the audit never catches you off guard.
          </p>
          <div class="hero-actions reveal in d3">
            <a href="/login" class="btn btn-primary">
              Enter the platform
              <svg width="18" height="18" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M13 7l5 5m0 0l-5 5m5-5H6"/></svg>
            </a>
            <a href="#stakes" class="btn btn-ghost">See how it works</a>
          </div>
          <div class="hero-trust reveal in d4">
            <div class="it"><div class="n">5</div><div class="l">Compliance modules</div></div>
            <div class="it"><div class="n">2</div><div class="l">Licences protected</div></div>
            <div class="it"><div class="n">1-click</div><div class="l">Audit evidence packs</div></div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="hero-stage">
          <img class="hero-signal" src="/img/landing/signal.svg" alt="Compliance status signal resting on green">
          <div class="hero-chip chip-1">
            <span class="ic" style="background:rgba(16,185,129,0.16)">
              <svg width="15" height="15" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="#34d399"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2.5" d="M5 13l4 4L19 7"/></svg>
            </span>
            <div>Fleet compliant<small>38 / 38 vehicles</small></div>
          </div>
          <div class="hero-chip chip-2">
            <span class="ic" style="background:rgba(245,158,11,0.16)">
              <svg width="15" height="15" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="#fbbf24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2.5" d="M12 9v4m0 4h.01M10.3 3.9L1.8 18a2 2 0 001.7 3h17a2 2 0 001.7-3L13.7 3.9a2 2 0 00-3.4 0z"/></svg>
            </span>
